# Docs writing (Mintlify)

Hand-edited pages only (not synced SDK/wiki copies). Full guide: `DOCS_WRITING.md`.

## Never repeat the page chrome

Mintlify already renders frontmatter above the body. Do **not** restate it.

| Frontmatter | Mintlify shows | Do not |
|-------------|----------------|--------|
| `title` | Page H1 | Add `# Same title` (or any body `#`) |
| `description` | Subtitle under H1 | Open the body with the same sentence / paraphrase |
| `sidebarTitle: Overview` | Sidebar label under a group | Name the **group** `Overview` as well |

**Bad** (double H1 + echoed subtitle):

```md
---
title: The SDK Stack
description: Foundation, Connection, and Experience — the SODAX dependency stack…
---

# The SDK stack

The SODAX developer suite is a dependency stack…
```

**Good** (body starts with new information):

```md
---
title: The SDK Stack
description: Foundation, Connection, and Experience — the SODAX dependency stack…
---

Integrate at the foundation for maximum control, or use the higher layers for speed.

### 1. Foundation: @sodax/sdk
```

- Prefer `###` / `##` section headings in the body — never a leading `#`.
- Group indexes: `title` = full H1, `sidebarTitle: Overview` under a **named** group (`HTTP API`, `SDKs`), not a group also called Overview.

## One home per page

List each path in **exactly one** `docs.json` tab, except the Home featured mix (Start here, featured How To, DevRel) which is also listed under Get Started / Reference / Resources. Link from hubs with cards; do not re-list deep Reference pages under Swap / Yield / etc.

## Solver language (entity separation)

**SODAX routes and settles. Solvers fill.** Never write "our solver", "the SODAX solver", "Swaps (Solver)", or imply SODAX trades, takes custody, or fills orders. Prefer "a solver on the marketplace" / "solvers". Do not proactively name Blockzen in outbound docs. Full table: `DOCS_WRITING.md`.
